  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#E8C27A><b>VENGEANCE OF THE FALLEN KNIGHT</b></color>\n<size=24><i>Once
    the sworn shield of the realm, the knight fell defending a crown betrayed from
    within. Risen from an unmarked grave, he walks the ruins of his kingdom to bring
    its traitors to judgement.</i></size>\n\n<color=#E8C27A><b>CONTROLS</b></color>\n<size=24>Move 
    <b>A / D</b>  or  <b>Arrow Keys</b>        Jump  <b>Space</b>  (press again to
    double jump)\nAttack  <b>J</b>        Roll  <b>Left Shift</b>        Block  <b>Right
    Mouse</b>        Heal  <b>H</b>        Pause  <b>Esc</b></size>\n\n<color=#E8C27A><b>CREDITS</b></color>\n<size=22>Environment
    art by Anokolisa   \u2022   Tiny RPG Mana Soul GUI by Gabriel \"tiopalada\" Lima
    (CC0)\nSoulslike Knight hero sprites   \u2022   Music from the \"Bonfires\" dark
    fantasy music pack</size>"
